548
00:34:00,799 --> 00:34:04,725
VER-003 · Which fixes are breaking · comparison 1

549
00:34:05,850 --> 00:34:08,925
Fix: Moving Angular and the CDK to peerDependencies.

550
00:34:08,925 --> 00:34:12,384
Breaking?: No for applications, which already install them; package

551
00:34:12,384 --> 00:34:15,844
managers may now report conflicts they used to hide..

552
00:34:17,219 --> 00:34:21,325
VER-003 · Which fixes are breaking · comparison 2

553
00:34:22,450 --> 00:34:24,316
Fix: Adding secondary entry points.

554
00:34:24,316 --> 00:34:29,544
Breaking?: No, if the primary entry point keeps re-exporting them for a deprecation period..

555
00:34:30,919 --> 00:34:34,926
